como su sonido.<\/p><p><ul><li>Reproducci\u00f3n inal\u00e1mbrica Bluetooth<br>Conecta hasta dos tel\u00e9fonos m\u00f3viles o tabletas al altavoz de forma inal\u00e1mbrica para disfrutar de un sonido JBL Pro.<\/li><li>PartyBoost sube el nivel de la fiesta<br>PartyBoost te permite conectar dos altavoces JBL compatibles para disfrutar de un sonido est\u00e9reo o m\u00e1s de dos para crear un entorno de sonido perfecto para una fiesta de verdad.<\/li><li>Con toda la potencia de la bater\u00eda integrada<br>No tendr\u00e1s que interrumpir la fiesta. La bater\u00eda integrada mantiene cargados tus dispositivos sin tener que interrumpir la fiesta.<\/li><\/ul><div><br><\/div><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><ul><li><b>Caracter\u00edsticas Audio<\/b><\/li><li>Respuesta de frecuencia din\u00e1mica: 60 Hz - 20k Hz<\/li><li>Potencia de salida, RMS: 40 Watt<\/li><li>Altavoz de graves: 52 x 90 mm<\/li><li>Tweeter de cupula: 20 mm<\/li><li>Radiadores de bajos pasivo: 2 x 65 mm<\/li><li><b>Medidas<\/b><\/li><li>Dimensiones (cm): 22 x 9.6 x 9.3<\/li><li>Dimensiones (in): 8.7 x 3.76 x 3.67<\/li><li>Weight (kgs): 0.96<\/li><li>Weight (lbs): 2.11<\/li><li><b>Caracter\u00edsticas de control y conexi\u00f3n<\/b><\/li><li>Perfiles Bluetooth: A2DP 1.3, AVRCP 1.6<\/li><li>Rango de frecuencia de transmisi\u00f3n Bluetooth: 2400 MHz - 2483.5 MHz<\/li><li>Transmisi\u00f3n de modulaci\u00f3n GFSK v\u00eda Bluetooth: GFSK, &#960;\/4 DQPSK, 8DPSK<\/li><li>Potencia de transmisi\u00f3n Bluetooth: &#8804; 20 dBm (EIRP)<\/li><li><b>Resistencia al agua:<\/b><\/li><li>Resistente al polvo y el agua conforme a la norma IP67<\/li><li><b>Bater\u00eda<\/b><\/li><li>Tipo de bater\u00eda: Li-ion polymer 27 Wh<\/li><li>Tiempo maximo de reproduccion: 20 Horas<\/li><li>Charging time (hrs): 4<\/li><li>Conector de carga: USB-C<\/li><li>Fuente de carga para telefonos: si<\/li><li><b>Caracter\u00edsticas<\/b><\/li><li>Bluetooth: S\u00ed<\/li><li>Charging cable: S\u00ed<\/li><li>USB para carga de dispositivos m\u00f3viles: S\u00ed<\/li><li>A prueba de agua: S\u00ed<\/li><li>Wireless: S\u00ed<\/li><li>Bater\u00eda recargable: S\u00ed<\/li><li>JBL PartyBoost: S\u00ed<\/li><li><b>Contenido de la caja<\/b><\/li><li>1 JBL Charge 5<\/li><li>1 x cable USB-C<\/li><li>1 hoja de seguridad<\/li><li>1 gu\u00eda de inicio r\u00e1pido<\/li><li>1 tarjeta de garant\u00eda<\/li><\/ul><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"JBL","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":1.64,"unit_price":143.34,"unit_price_tax":143.34,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Altavoces","sub_category":"Altavoces","quantity":0,"brand":"JBL","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_jbl-alt%20charge%205%20bl%20v2_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":138.34}}},"4560158879966":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["4560158879966",false],"wholesale_price":[6.99,false],"price":[11.99,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.35",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:146561","Cat. IDs: 71","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 71","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/88daf7578767b57a5baef63471fe21c8.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Auriculares Toshiba D160HL\/ con Micr\u00f3fono\/ Jack 3.5\/ Azules","category":"Auriculares","sub_category":"Auriculares","unit_price":11.99,"reference":"D160HL","ean13":"4560158879966","weight":"0.35","quantity